# Publishing is done by CI (.github/workflows/release.yml).
# Never put a token in this file; CI injects NODE_AUTH_TOKEN.
#
# `provenance=true` used to live here as well as in publishConfig. It is gone:
# npm only attests builds from a public source repository and this one is
# private. docs/releasing.md explains what that costs and how to restore it —
# and note that setting it here overrides an absent publishConfig entry, which
# is what made an earlier removal look complete when it was not.
